# "?" Assignment 4 "?" Group11 - autoencoder + PCA pipeline (Group 11)
# Everything below is REGENERATED by run_all.py in ~4.5 minutes on the RTX 2050,
# so none of it belongs in version control. The global patterns above (*.json,
# *.pt, *.png, *.pdf) already cover the files; these entries make the intent
# explicit and catch anything that slips through.

# Run artefacts: checkpoints, logs, status snapshots, per-task JSON, figures.
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/results_final/
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/results_*/
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/logs/
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/pilot_findings.json

# Pre-rerun comparison snapshot (created only to verify reproducibility).
Assignment4/_baseline_snapshot/

# LaTeX report: main.tex IS tracked (it is the source of truth); the compiled
# PDF and every build artefact are not. The PDF is delivered through Moodle,
# not through git, and is rebuilt with: pdflatex main.tex
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/main.pdf
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.aux
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.log
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.out
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.toc
Assignment4/Group11_Assignment4_code/report/*.lof

